Feature: Generated process server REST contracts
 Scenario: Publish a process to the worker queue after committing its state
  Given generated process host
  When I construct a REST request with header "x-chenile-tenant-id" and value "tenant0"
  And I POST a REST request to URL "/process" with payload
  """
  {"processDefName":"{{testProcessType}}","args":{"filename":"generated-test.dat"}}
  """
  Then the REST response key "mutatedEntity.processType" is "{{testProcessType}}"
  And the REST response key "mutatedEntity.tenant" is "tenant0"
  And the committed process is published to Kafka
